  "id": "grit-scale",
  "term": "Grit Scale",
  "definition": "The Grit Scale is a psychological measure of grit, a noncognitive personal trait involving sustained passion and perseverance toward long-term goals. It assesses two related aspects: consistency of interests over time and perseverance of effort when facing challenges.",
